stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Create order / reserve stock
    PENDING --> CONFIRMED: SUCCESS payment / consume stock
    PENDING --> FAILED: FAILED payment / release stock
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: Customer cancellation / release stock
    PENDING --> EXPIRED: Safe expiry / release stock
    note right of PENDING
      Pending/unresolved provider outcomes
      must not be expired. Reconciliation
      applies known provider results through
      the same callback transition path.
    end note
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
